Dataset license: research and evaluation use (v0.1)
====================================================

The photographs under `data/` in this release (the "Amber Ridge" room sets) may be used for
research and evaluation purposes: downloading them, running staging tools on them, scoring
the results with the MASB scorer, and publishing scores and small illustrative crops.

You may not redistribute the photographs themselves, sell them, or use them for advertising
or as training data, without written permission from the rights holder. Credit the source as
"Amber Ridge set, Multi-Angle Staging Benchmark (credit: Ben Hinton)".

Why not Creative Commons yet: the rights position on these specific photographs is being
confirmed. Once it is, this file will be replaced by a CC BY 4.0 grant. Contributed room sets
from other photographers are licensed under CC BY 4.0 as described in CONTRIBUTING.md, and a
room's own `meta.json` states its license.

The scorer and all code in this repository are MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). Results files are
released under CC0 (no rights reserved).
